考虑分数序列：<br>
$F = \{ \frac{23}{95}, \frac{57}{23}, \frac{17}{39}, \frac{130}{17}, \frac{11}{14}, \frac{35}{11}, \frac{19}{13}, \frac{1}{19}, \frac{35}{2}, \frac{13}{7}, \frac{7}{1} \}$<br>
<!-- F = { 23/95, 57/23, 17/39, 130/17, 11/14, 35/11, 19/13, 1/19, 35/2, 13/7, 7/1 }-->
<br>
我们定义以下算法（n是整数）：<br>
<pre>func(n){
  i = 0;
  Start:
    j = 0;
    while (F[j]*n not integer) {
        j++;
    }
    i++;
    n = n*F[j]
    if (n has only factors 2 and 3){
        print(i);
    }
    goto Start;
}
</pre>
